OL,3,APorts denied request to land 120
OL,4,Amigrants in RNLI boats
OL,5,
OL,6,FRequests to accept the landing of RNLI
OL,7,Fboats carrying 120 migrants intercepted
OL,8,Foff the Isle of Wight were refused by
OL,9,Fboth Portsmouth harbour and Southampton
OL,10,FPort.
OL,12,FWhen the migrants were landed on Sunday
OL,13,Fat Eastney, in Langstone Harbour,
OL,14,Fanti-migrant protesters blocked the
OL,15,Froad.
OL,17,FAssociated British Ports (ABP), which
OL,18,Foperates Southampton, said it was not
OL,19,Fthe closest port and it "did not have
OL,20,Fsuitable reception facilities
OL,21,Favailable".
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
