OL,3,AUkrainian TV channel building hit by
OL,4,ARussian drone as five killed in Kyiv
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Russian drone has struck a Ukrainian
OL,7,FTV channel headquarters in Kyiv,
OL,8,Finjuring at least five people as
OL,9,Fjournalists were broadcasting live,
OL,10,FPresident Volodymyr Zelensky has said.
OL,12,FZelensky said the daytime attack was a
OL,13,F"new page in Russian degradation",
OL,14,Fwhile photos shared by the president
OL,15,Fshowed a partially collapsed building.
OL,17,FAt least five people have been killed
OL,18,Fin overnight and daytime Russian
OL,19,Fstrikes on Kyiv. A separate attack on a
OL,20,Fpassenger train in southern Ukraine
OL,21,Fkilled a female employee, officials
OL,22,Fhave said.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
